      51.06,
      365.73,
      286.86,
      460.3
    ],
    "text": "My Ref. : RBK/LAN/AQURE/A3/27. I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section 1 of section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.980000019073486,
      9.0,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      51.06,
      460.45,
      286.83,
      556.33
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired: The allotments of land in extent of 1.5466 Hectares depicted as Lot No. 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 and 6 in the preliminary plan No. K/3491 prepared by the Surveyor General, within the boundaries shown below situated in the village of Kaudaulla in the minor division of Kinigoda, Korale in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Rambukkana in the District of Kegalle in Sabaragamuwa Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
