    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally or by agents, duly authorized in writing, before me at Rambukkana Divisional Secretariat on the 30th July 2015 at 10.00 a.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
